; Assamese — language options only.
;
; Inno Setup ships no wizard translation for this language, so the installer
; loads its own English messages (`compiler:Default.isl`, listed first in
; `MessagesFile`) and this file only replaces what the Select Language page
; needs: the name to show. Everything the installer authors itself follows the
; selected language through `[CustomMessages]`.
[LangOptions]
LanguageName=অসমীয়া
